      "source": "Method to be called when <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> is closed and the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is prepared.",
