    {
      "source": "Add an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a> that will be called with a\n<a href=\"BootstrapContextClosedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContextClosedEvent</code></a> when the <a href=\"BootstrapContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.bootstrap\"><code>BootstrapContext</code></a> is closed and\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> has been prepared.",
